WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,440
That's all. Nothing else to say.

2
00:00:04,030 --> 00:00:05,950
You did a good job at the restaurant yesterday

3
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:09,630
I have always been rewarded for my merits and punished for my mistakes.

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,820
I'm treating you tonight

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:16,140
Why don't I take you to drink wine?

6
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:20,780
The young master said, why don't you take us to drink flower wine?

7
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:22,620
Don't even want to go

8
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:36,320
Forgive me for taking so long

9
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,830
It's a waste of time asking me to tell you

10
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,630
The big man should lead his troops and kill him directly.

11
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,750
Steal money, food, women

12
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,740
Do nothing here every day

13
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:55,780
I've had enough

14
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,460
I'm going out later

15
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,860
Meet the beauties of Chu State
